### MCP Resources (catalog browsing, no rate limit)
- atlas://catalog, atlas://technique/{technique_id}, atlas://case-study/{case_study_id}
- d3fend://catalog, d3fend://defense/{defense_id}
- cwe://catalog, cwe://weakness/{cwe_id}

### MCP Prompts
- contrast_triage(target, perspective='red'|'blue') — conditional triage chain (auto-detects target type: CVE / ATLAS / ATT&CK / CWE / hash / IP / domain)
- security_audit(domain) — single-target full audit workflow
- vulnerability_check(product) — quick CVE search by product

### HTTP Transport (remote)
POST https://api.contrastcyber.com/mcp/
Headers: Content-Type: application/json, Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
Body: JSON-RPC 2.0 (initialize, tools/list, tools/call)

### Stdio Transport (local)
Add to .mcp.json:
{"mcpServers": {"contrastapi": {"command": "python3", "args": ["/path/to/mcp_server.py"]}}}

